flowchart TD
  START[Boot] --> INIT[Initialize GPIO and sensor]
  INIT --> NET{Wi-Fi connected?}
  NET -- No --> RETRY[Retry with backoff; keep local safe state]
  RETRY --> NET
  NET -- Yes --> CLOUD{Blynk connected?}
  CLOUD -- No --> LOCAL[Continue local sensing; mark cloud unavailable]
  LOCAL --> CLOUD
  CLOUD -- Yes --> RUN[Timed sampling + telemetry + validated commands]
  RUN --> SENSOR{Sensor reading valid?}
  SENSOR -- No --> ERR[Log fault; do not publish bogus value]
  ERR --> RUN
  SENSOR -- Yes --> RUN
